From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Henrik Klee <henrik@goat-code.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 00:17:52 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: Keep the boot display powered over s2idle
 on every SoC

The display is what the boot loader set up: simpledrm on its framebuffer, or
a driver adopting its pipe, and neither restores it after power loss. T8010
and the iPad 5 keep these domains on; do the same on the other boards, with
the domains each already names for its framebuffer. Tested only on T8010.

Assisted-by: LLM
